{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"12c6dab9f04940b5ba4376ad9f884315","title":"查询可用穿戴设备","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V15","anchorList":[],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110241\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110241\"></a>   <h1>查询可用穿戴设备</h1>   <div>    <p>Wear Engine提供查询用户是否有可用穿戴设备（即支持Wear Engine能力且与手机侧运动健康App处于连接状态的穿戴设备）的接口。</p>    <p>该接口的调用无需用户授权，建议开发者在使用Wear Engine其他API接口前先实现该接口功能。</p>    <ol>     <li><span>第三方应用调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716\" target=\"_blank\">HiWear</a>中的<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwear-0000001060938716#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951394__getDeviceClient-android_content_Context-\" target=\"_blank\">getDeviceClient</a>方法，获取<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/deviceclient-0000001060779120\" target=\"_blank\">DeviceClient</a>对象。</span></li>     <li><span>调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/deviceclient-0000001060779120#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950697__hasAvailableDevices--\" target=\"_blank\">hasAvailableDevices</a>方法，查询用户是否有可用穿戴设备。</span>      <p></p>      <pre class=\"screen\">// 步骤1：获取DeviceClient对象\n// this 表示应用上下文Context对象\nDeviceClient deviceClient = HiWear.getDeviceClient(this);\n\n// 步骤2：调用hasAvailableDevices方法，查询用户是否有可用穿戴设备\ndeviceClient.hasAvailableDevices().addOnSuccessListener(new OnSuccessListener&lt;Boolean&gt;() {\n    @Override\n    public void onSuccess(Boolean result) {\n        // 查询是否有可用设备任务执行成功，result值表示是否有可用设备\n    }\n}).addOnFailureListener(new OnFailureListener() {\n    @Override\n    public void onFailure(Exception e) {\n        // 查询是否有可用设备任务执行失败\n    }\n});</pre>      <p></p></li>    </ol>   </div>   <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"query-available-wearable-0000001054326166","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2026-10-10 04:06:03","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"],"showBeta":0,"deviceVersion":""}}